---
// "Exhibit 01" — the animated HomeLabCore flask made by Codex
// (handoff/phase2-visuals/animations-20261005, used unchanged). It is a
// self-contained SVG with a 4-second SMIL loop: code symbols move inside the
// liquid and steam rises; it stays still when reduced motion is preferred.
// The site header already shows the wordmark, so the frame crops the SVG to
// the flask and shows it large, on a light plate in both themes.
---
<figure class="exhibit">
  <div class="exhibit__plate">
    <div class="exhibit__crop">
      <img src="/assets/brand/homelabcore-animated.svg" width="194" height="50" alt="The HomeLabCore flask: coding symbols move gently in its blue liquid while steam rises from the neck." decoding="async">
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="exhibit__label">
    <span>Exhibit 01</span>
    <span>The HomeLabCore flask, animated</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
